// OTD-0109 - Web Shell Activity on Internet-Facing OT-Adjacent Server
// Source: 02-detection/sigma/threat-actor/07_web-shell-activity-on-internet-facing-ot-adjacent-server.yml
// ATT&CK for ICS: n/a
// Severity: critical
// PLACEHOLDERS in <angle brackets> must be baselined before use.
//
SecurityEvent
| where (ParentImage in ("\w3wp.exe", "\httpd.exe", "\nginx.exe") and NewProcessName in ("\cmd.exe", "\powershell.exe"))
| project TimeGenerated, SourceIP, DestinationIP, Protocol, FunctionCode, AccountName, Computer
| order by TimeGenerated desc
